d to finish setting up payouts for your account.","04ffeed5eb4981be3636152fa002b6f4":"Payouts won't process through Squarespace Payments.","051f6603517d9c3cb02f916fa29e61a5":"Payment and payout management on Squarespace","053dd92ad1d19e1e2ff24060d3b7f898":"Squarespace Privacy Policy","05affeaecb8ba01ca688ad0aac12ce7f":"I would like to request an appeal to use Squarespace Payments on my site, {websiteURL}","06011cf4044f152b95bc50c9429ed9e7":"Take advantage of our discounted rate of {lineBreak}{promoRate} on all card transactions until {promoExpiry}. Setup takes 2 steps.","061129574278f72ed6fe46a8aedc00a2":"Please wait a minute and try again.","06ee7bdf47ff590605e88caea6996cae":"Privacy Policy","076853cc6dbe29cf6cb88c6416e6fe25":"switch to Squarespace Payments","07c7851284d11adbca47333e720f2393":"Your account no longer requires reserves","09fd511609dd6b84f7ccb7790360a5b5":"The only Squarespace login that\u2019s able to:","0b52d5d24da7ef21ddde8189ec39abef":"Need to start over?","0b73e12a85ce64b415d7fbfc1fcc190c":"Close","0bd8fb16852aadc132b31e93fc18452e":"create a new Squarespace Payments account","0ca9c4d3783cfb8bded2c0ed0ab2a2f5":"Learn more","0cb652d46401461fa7f156f0d36b5fd4":"Payouts will be sent the next business day after incoming payments process.","0d2cf5a5cfe327e03dcc5f36226ae9db":"Verify your email address to protect your account","0d4aa8ee13ae0d2dd2d96ab7768fb87b":"{actionButton} to enable payouts.","0f474b1bd7e5dbf8257d28736249fd22":"View Rates","0f72a082193673b1b715b3b84523f87d":"Payments toward your financing will be automatically applied from your Squarespace Payments sales. {learnMoreLink}","0fce5fafd6f3af89a5dbe792282ff88d":"Payouts are pending","105e01f57e00dea268f3de89b09c32e3":"Squarespace Payments connected","10fba45106a5a6905586eb57ce030fbc":"Powerful payments designed for your business.","110f402e2f22f59dba227b23469d928e":"To receive payouts, your bank account must use {currency}. Alternative currency payouts are not supported.","11978ea90f265f04ec2cf5ccd8b884d0":"Squarespace Payments is not set as your primary payment processor. Orders placed with previously saved payment methods will still be processed. ","12b9de1dd5e63798a9568a40beb6612e":"Learn more","13238429c2d3f7cec4aaa1ae9437398c":"{paymentMethod} now available! Start today for a low {achRate} processing rate on bank payments","13b99ecf490f175b3f83ad83daf2f8d0":"Start accepting payments right away. Customers can pay with all major credit cards, Klarna, and Apple Pay \u2014 with more methods coming soon.","1458e47f4a704c4567679843aafd0451":"Something went wrong. Please try submitting again.","1504e787c88571b1ee94685f4c8748c1":"Activate lower rates with more payment methods, including all major credit cards, ACH, Apple Pay, and Afterpay","152a9446088801e0aeba30e555e74c8a":"Manage all payments and payouts directly on Squarespace","15c400c7795e4d6a48d2353907f23958":"Unable to accept payments","164da4dffe4bbe3ce7dae72608022f88":"Access to flexible business financing through Squarespace Capital","16c8b1e11e3b0c134f2a3d5d4395aadb":"Start accepting payments right away. Customers can pay with all major credit cards, Klarna, Apple Pay, Google Pay and Afterpay \u2014 with more methods coming soon.","16d78ebb0fbeca138962c7119c8ad051":"Explore plans","172cb6b0f308bebc7f8886182c64b725":"Subscribe to start accepting payments with new low rates.","175ffaf2c0d4f38dd564108b28809e51":{one:"The holding period for your reserves is now 1 day.",other:"The holding period for your reserves is now {%n} days."},"181139b6d5e410dcebe0b4b53bc11b9e":"Your Stripe account will be disconnected from Squarespace","182044e9bebb724975383db67721294c":"PROCESSING RATES","1972a357c9c511e66be3dacef4bb875f":"This may take another minute or two.","1994254b77e481817a75229f58e64de9":"This may be due to lack of funds, permissions issues, or an unknown error with your bank. To fix this, please contact your bank or connect a new bank account. We will attempt to resolve the negative balance to unlock payouts and refunds.","1acc8376698d2ec8d14bdfe2fe70954d":"We are working on verifying your information.","1b32faae24710a41b4c902e8d632e211":"Start accepting invoice payments right away. Clients can pay with all major credit cards, {optionalACHText} Klarna, Apple Pay, and Afterpay \u2014 with more methods coming soon.","1b682b877834131f9859b21b17063c70":"ACH processing rates","1bb27c98a5c762c4c5ea3d58d7a32644":"Your verification code is included on the deposit we added to your recently connected bank account.","1c0fe698b5920a061a508f09178ff943":"LIMITED TIME OFFER","1c267d497f1f27eac52d44c9aaca58fa":"We may ask for some additional information if it's been a while since you set up Stripe.","1c7cf7421551b69a94dedadd10677a0c":"Activate your new ACH rates with Squarespace Payments","1c92f01210f770fcffb4d50bc756747e":"Your customers\u2019 saved payment information will be transferred in 3\u201310 days.","1da596b6fd8d80a5d88116ebd0e8161e":"The new bank account you connected is a savings account. To change your payout account, you'll need to connect a {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} to Squarespace Payments.","1dad4133523456888feab431ff2f687e":"connect a {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING}","1db1311007a59bbd14b2573a5b3b3cbd":"You'll be ready to accept payments as soon as we finish verifying your information. This may take a couple of minutes.","1df8a5885ae43c554244ad5d8733023c":"Accept all major credit cards, Klarna, Apple Pay, and Afterpay \u2014 with even more payment methods coming soon","1f79f252eb8dabaaac8e3df62ea26956":"Update your information","21793d090ef2ee13aecf6113c4f9af42":"Your account is suspended. {actionButton} for help.","22a5061df7ff5362cbe1f3f251649ab7":"Credit card rates as low as {feeRatePlusConstant} on {selectPlansLink}","22b8c2cb55d3f02be61873db77c8c994":"Learn more","232a83c140d1e34e4db63933e19ad080":"Activating your account...","233440aa1b7d7e9de89fc013195d7d9a":"You're connected to Squarespace Payments","237e2ff2997b930c648c872d672a2203":"Savings accounts can't be used for payouts","23f355af2ed37c553f1f69c8a383a015":"CHANGE BANK ACCOUNT","24b4ab3871eca1fe9957a20b6af6c1da":"Payments Manager","24cdd1d7ffe205990954317a563be11c":"Automated verification usually takes less than a few minutes and is secure.","2561a61c173d15ad215f416621e94327":"Manage payments and payouts directly on Squarespace","25f97a541639ac69ea04645e6c4ad3ed":"{verificationButton} to verify your {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING}. {actionButton}","26554f420574111dfc73b67cd787758c":"Your Squarespace Payments account now requires reserves","268232de48e82598b2db43d5c674ea09":"You're ready to start selling","26b7e7d749edc4468e979dbe8f5ff3d3":"Pending","273e7cd5bafb045f63881144bea0e230":"Domestic American Express cards and Corporate or Business card issued by Visa and Mastercard.","282145f1dbeed4a14b52990d41902816":"Upgrade for lower rates","2836377817bc3fe9abab031b7e87cf53":"Accept all major credit cards, Klarna, and Apple Pay \u2014 with even more payment methods coming soon","288a0de071571c4b0d4d42c96ba6233e":"Importing your information","28e6653a7573d978a54ad56a92a95f32":"Accept and continue","28ed0bd6063dabd480755773579a5ea3":"AUTHORISE BANK DEBITS","2911a70673928198414041b157dfae4e":"Add feedback","2a738c588a3698cc5505293586c3ee66":"You'll need to cancel your pending bank verification in order to edit your payout account. Canceling verification will remove your pending bank connection from Squarespace Payments and keep your current bank as the default payout bank account.","2a95961a4171193793a0375bc9db397d":"connecting a {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING}","2ae7fd72fb92d33d13f73531da5d07be":"Due to a persistent negative balance of {availableBalance}, your Squarespace Payments account has been suspended. Your online store will no longer be able to accept payments through Squarespace Payments, and you will see a limited version of your account dashboard. Customer Support will reach out to you with next steps to unlock your account.","2b2cace922064b4785e136760d6730eb":"Set up automated tax.","2b451d00038dd9da10c6bc99d8b9fcea":"Submit your information to keep your account active.","2c796e84ffe1b2a0f9cd5d3fe77535bb":"Due to a persistent negative balance, your Squarespace Payments account has been suspended. Your online store will no longer be able to accept payments through Squarespace Payments, and you will see a limited version of your account dashboard. Customer Support will reach out to you with next steps to unlock your account.","2c85d9bb03344922199112e6f64e0582":"Recommended","2d9d72f9f637a4ad5c9706dc0a75d97e":"Close","2f29ab343d1b8fea2661a1395ab816e4":"Check your email for a link to verify your email address.","2f72fe8ad3153cc6c3929e977865ed6e":"Authorise debits to activate payouts","2fe9106714c1f25bb3071de29f37fc14":"Test","3060d456f8c20f8b8ca87e35fb08cb34":"Activating your account is taking longer than expected. In the meantime, payments will continue to process through Stripe.","30b2e080931747e0eb0888260d0439c5":"Provide information about your business to start using Squarespace Payments.","324b20c39e0f33a458c8d3fff56a2f00":"close","32922651dd2938e5cdca072e8988846c":"{rate} for credit cards","32da54116001ec51fe5cfa7a4d43abd9":"Low fees starting at only {feeRatePlusConstant} per transaction. {learnMoreAboutFeesLink}","32e6c5b7103838d770c90093ec030280":"Connect your preferred {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} for no interruption in payouts.","332851f0cdbb4a51ecd27cfab628645e":"Clearpay","33eae1abdedfde1a812499c40e86d150":"bank account","33fe1bc364cd5e9805d9d8e7e83a3e28":"Restart setup","345c43798e25bb474c7ce43a5c742a96":"Your bank account {last4} is connected. {actionButton}","35c310dffb509c76c4ea513d269d1f17":"LEARN MORE","35d14b49e2acc11667933436ac2e4dda":"This is a required field.","36a0e3dbfa5ede66639b3a71dd388060":"VERIFY IDENTITY","371ec0bb10b0185f7cdd1ad4a6349371":"Start accepting invoice payments right away. Clients can pay with all major credit cards, Klarna, Apple Pay, and Afterpay \u2014 with more methods coming soon.","374fdfea