 can also transfer ownership to another admin by contacting Customer Support. {learnMoreLink}","400c374c48d0f0bd574645fcef8f4269":"Instant payout","4069afd5a65aec760579bb570f1e8216":"Rates apply to each transaction based on your country of business operation and customer payment methods. {learnMoreLink}","416becbb11a324d10d0bbb8a170c4d51":"ACTIVE PAYMENT METHODS","4274944ce9f8103a29fb99c9ea77a394":"Help","42b46adfd5e94429208961a10d9ef9bb":"Refunded","439c62427048cf75eab90008296a9d2d":"Close","43b19d4207ea40d63a5e9f302242219a":"START IMPORT","4400c680742ff93441e2baf4cf3f76ea":"What to know before you switch","44424899460a45e149cbc897ffef205e":"Detached","44a593177cc5a46e20295e257ab8b50e":"This usually takes 1-2 business days. We'll send you an automatic update when the verification is complete. Payouts to your new account will be enabled after your information is verified.","453cc3581c39dd62dccb76d7d10d2d61":"The {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} you connected could not be verified. Try again with an account in good standing and registered to {legalBusinessName}. Your first payout will be sent 15-19 days after successfully connecting your account.","46d1d8d5ab92edbadcd47d5de5c12758":"DO THIS LATER","46dba3ff84849124c3f41ad26f3c67dd":"Dismiss Capital offer banner","4712e82782f051703e1708d8ac05977c":"View more options","47b4b012a615d38491e19e463b08679f":"Paused","48dc1c3da4171124440360add91541fe":"UPDATE BANK","48e2e381a19ca7b0a591abd9a2c2cf47":"We need some more information","49467b62c6fe78dbcdfda69dac821f05":"Welcome to Squarespace Payments","49667b42839935f0f7de0fdcc0b4a328":"Failed","49c3df268cd812c733936cd1577af02f":"PROCESSING RATES ON YOUR PLAN","4a073f99fa036e79afa2eef9faa0dcef":"Get our lowest card rates with new Plus and Advanced plans","4a26201edf7851defd90117f517a48b3":"Everything you get with Squarespace Payments","4a64124ce4ee7ce7068417129f28892d":"Discounted rate of {feeRatePlusConstant} on all card transactions until {expiry} {learnMoreLink}","4a8c22e0db790310198f024bf1f8df86":"upgrade for lower rates","4ae5de145944f3a02e100db953b87e74":"Your payments will now be processed through Squarespace Payments. Customers' existing subscriptions and saved payment information could take up to 10 days to transfer.","4ae89be19437245a95b464093605789c":"Learn more","4b37319958de319a3d68200a8df2239a":"Activate your new processing rates with Squarespace Payments. Setup takes 2 steps.","4b477f48ea63e87d3ff477c6c9ea139d":"CLOSE & SAVE FOR LATER","4b821f66d0e49b0a65f6f8b9addce593":"Payments won't process through Squarespace Payments.","4b84c1a8fbb72ec5785e1b0effbe5d97":"Payments from your customers will start coming through Squarespace Payments. Connect your preferred {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} for no interruption in payouts.","4ba6dc0c8539172c29d0f2b850772307":"Review a recent payment dispute","4d02db1db81557c368b9a617d9f746f6":"chequing account","4d827823343a0aef073356fb7d82ddf6":"We're still verifying your account information. We'll send you an email when Squarespace Payments is connected.","4da056cc5c7e55c93a2373c5e3448c16":"Learn more","4e6f2a271c8dd2ebcfdf124f463cf878":"Blocked","4e94ceee1c1c7424858aed55ed4e3426":"Complete account setup and {actionButton}.","4ed60cd9fb8450d621ffef2fd7beddc8":"Your Squarespace Payments account is suspended. Contact Support for help.","4eea55fd8b0635a5f29ca8bd3f7d614b":"Connect or update bank accounts","4ef7c490e6cec5e4a1a9929ec125971d":"Your information is in review.","4f31a390f5857320daf4ea02201a5c04":"The {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} you connect must be registered to {legalBusinessName}.","4fde5d2ebb72f3f7e6d172c5f2018731":"CLOSE","4fe2ffd8b26ff2f006b4c674ef7d5fde":"If you don't want to transfer your information, {createAccountButton} instead. {additionalCopy}","502f8a8e60e4600530d636120e2b962d":"Unable to receive payouts","505e486574f531c470ad024fdc2ca4b5":"TRY AGAIN","50e3ca9eb28d736c7c46e97ea2f84b4e":"VIEW RATES","5116a08b00179d5e2160af2741aa34e7":"CLOSE","513e09f0b95fd6e4a4eb78a1f621897c":"We're still