{optionalACHText} and Afterpay \u2014 with more methods coming soon.","5fbb9585a6449bed7f070165da957b18":"Ready to receive payouts","5fd5f9de5343ce0eb981912479185488":"Reserves are temporary holds on a portion of incoming payments that help cover refunds, chargebacks, and other losses. Your reserves will automatically be added to future payouts if no refunds or chargebacks occur.","5ff03055acf7004e4630a5d20e24ed11":"Reconnect your bank account","605811fa16a2fd239bbbae7ed8183324":"CONNECT {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING}","616d1ec60c4b34b672df0d1dde5bef16":"Your discounted processing rates are active","617df3f7968a0fa2f5660b78903086c2":"Domestic American Express cards.","619b0ba8dc5212bb24f32e7a74b51b0f":"CONTINUE","6223232596fd174867a56420ee6545ab":"The payment amount and fees {totalDisputeAmount} were debited from your Squarespace Payments account.","628159704e7347612f82410a93e95bc0":"Upload a bank statement to verify your account","62e0461d8610ea5ee8f3565b6a4f2e88":"Start using Squarespace Payments","62fa0fb3e3a59aea34976b53bb8595c5":"Import your account from Stripe for instant setup, no change in fees, and no business interruption","630178e85730f5c3aa5a121d2d8b1d89":"Verify with Plaid","630547b6168e1532328fe1be0b6ec395":"Explore answers to common questions about setting up Squarespace Payments.","63419714e83994ddcb9d5e094830a7f8":"Your negative balance has been resolved","6347fd319ab2407388457409e2b0f907":"More options","634842e5cb6b592633be0981baeb1f67":"More information is needed for Squarespace Payments","63a1034c8d7bcd741eb52bed02565cb3":"All of your customer information and past orders will still be accessible on Squarespace.","63e686beff4d94c6e04401afed1afc5c":"Cardholders disputed payments made in your store. {learnMoreLink}","64bbea331471489224f6dd94ca87c0e0":"Verify your business to receive payouts","665b718b2a3eee3b61fc4521ac807c10":"We've received your information","6684a66c465812b13f356735fa737fc7":"Your Squarespace Payments account is being activated","6863