Klarna, Apple Pay, and Clearpay \u2014 with more methods coming soon.","7537b4ed57bbdb787fcd745e5f2d1576":"You\u2019re currently unable to accept payments with Squarespace Payments. Funds in your account balance have been moved to reserves to cover chargebacks, refunds, and other losses.","75b4fecc4087dc0ed561e240794cbdc8":"Standard processing rate: {processingRate} per transaction for domestic credit and debit cards. {viewRatesModalLink}","76ba4113a941d5efe2310fd5bc39e634":"Failed","77096571a7048998a05df0124fb8bb5a":"Squarespace Payments - Suspended Account","7751a6dbf138207f52ade7e0061a59d9":"Couldn't load account information","782ab1f670805ab34aa98ab147fa5b78":"Complete account setup","784c6cd8bbed5ab0f58858ad6c6d2198":"Identity information needed for Squarespace Payments","792bfb23dacc704273ea85a047bb03ae":"VIEW DETAILS","7957c8f80ae54670110739b4b4853dad":"You have received new payments that resolved your negative balance. However, you still need to connect a new bank account to unlock payouts.","79eb69ce8e94ecfa9293e320222fbeea":"Payouts are paused","79f1f1600f6decfecbf90b72ed453c65":"Get access to lower card rates and more payment methods, including all major credit cards, Klarna, and bank debits","7a0e5c415a3d46f2ba7d27f5e1acf7b1":"We encountered an error when importing your information. Please try connecting to Squarespace Payments again.","7a1e252f242897627dadd09a90a13787":"Your Squarespace Payments account has been suspended","7b072ea95d735f05c4a67b33b7b325bd":"Your Stripe account will be detached from Squarespace","7b5c0f95a4d433d80811f952a03acb69":"After your first payment, you'll connect a bank account to process payouts.","7c4c36359ced061327be6b308e30e60f":"Act as the financial beneficiary for this business","7cc21d5f4a6777159267182d6a3f0d23":"Action needed to accept payments","7ec96bac5fae71364bdc0405d2f043be":"All other new orders will be processed through Squarespace Payments.","7fceb648089cc2490f668d6e8174faa2":"When you select \u201CVerify Identity\u201D below, you will be taken to our partner Plaid to have your identity verified in accordance with the {privacyPolicyLink}.","81706eab8518483cfe5ce9992868fc4d":"Discounted card processing rates of {feeRatePlusConstant} per transaction.","81763ff17215cb861b309a83a2f31ee4":"Customers' saved payment methods will not be transferred and some transactions may continue to process on Stripe.","8187683d4fa20aaa0326bd1a66358334":"Your avatar","824ca3b1d99b823f38f4ac5bcd2964a0":"Select country","8259649760b7b52ed5c873ad6cc390fd":"Built-in dispute tool helps you monitor chargebacks and protect your business","836667d97b32f9ce83bc07292f99d7f8":"START VERIFICATION","847525f933c58d7588cec7c233a6eb1f":'By clicking "Start verification", you consent to automated identity verification with our third party vendor Plaid.View the {privacyPolicyLink} for more information.',"84d54b73d59bfe8f49f499d115eb3ac2":"We'll import your identity and business information from Stripe to activate Squarespace Payments.","869a501f85d92f914ce3d77f7a6263c5":"Manage your money where you make it. Switch instantly with no interruption to your business or checkout experience.","86c0d04baa5209909f9a0ad8ea4a93e3":"Until this problem is resolved you will not be able to receive payouts or process refunds, but your store can continue to accept purchases. To fix this, please reach out to your bank or connect a new bank account.","8710119ae8217893315c1008bfade578":"Payments are not yet enabled","883a5c98eb53324131a8a35474313640":"Credit and debit cards","8853d2b8cf1a0bff0ae77b8c94936414":"Manage all your payments directly on Squarespace, so you can get back to focusing on your business.","8863812a823439d838c0a4e5af051c33":"Paid","88a868600ffe0b3e43f8f1f9d40e1c1d":"Refund in progress","899ad7ee08fc97450af0bc4552cc1072":"We need some more time","89b4447497843fb95738eebf21044503":"Squarespace Payments is suspended on my site, {websiteURL}","8c355a7915673e8186c20637e21def6a":"Select the country where your bank is located.","8c851ad6d4b9f3b161a0c71f098d6f47":"Turn on Squarespace Payments to start accepting ACH payments at {rate} per transaction. ","8ca44c2f3746f276c6c67382ab203732":"A disputed payment was debited from your account","8cab5e3ac8911200875254328712e495":"Limited time offer","8d1137f1b6f97e75e21dc2bde60cf0ce":"CHANGE PAYOUT ACCOUNT","8d76eeab14cff2c903d2eea5257ebcd5":"Verification complete and payouts enabled","8d84e60d7a12e389e4dfa53738abbf82":"Branch Sort Code","8da492f1f830456e82e6f5a21e23b425":"Response submitted","8dcfd6a19ee92a07152e74e82e41b481":"Cancel","8e3cbfb603e29cd9e0310ffc6358a7b1":"You can now accept payments in your store.","8e6819031f0428da127cc095079a2aa1":"You have until {actionRequiredBy} to review and respond.","8f8b29b616cd6c67928435ca5b43a836":"Payouts are paused while we review your account. There's no action needed from you right now \u2014 reviews may take 2\u20133 days. You can still accept new payments during the review process.","8fc2f96df528dacb4cb3e3a02f3a0d48":"Activate payouts by {actionButton}","906a4ad5a31ca64ee4f666736359a59c":"The {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} you connected could not be verified. Try again with an account in good standing. Your first payout will be sent 15-19 days after successfully connecting your account.","90cad24d82386298df7d58c58c0fb304":"Providing this information will help us protect your account and ensure no interruption in payments or payouts.","90d9e438214bc145e4eee53c68c9665c":"Premium cards","91f8a5a56700297fdec12671cf0c3d8e":"Rates vary based on your location and payment methods.","92190dbb51755a3596867d5dbdc38859":"HELP CENTER","92843ee5daf4573dd60c180436ccd5f3":"Your bank account is connected. {actionButton}","9293060305779502be0953f9d5ae69bf":"ACH rates as low as","92ca2f7458904050619b6778f721bfae":"Instant Payout","92fcad82cf60f29e652aa1acc9b719f6":"Accept payment methods like Klarna and ACH, and manage your business on Squarespace. Setup takes 2 steps.","938a46d6c592569db9f972ef1317ef5c":"Bank account connected","93ed1113b2e92292a24808a3214f7415":"BACK","93eeb2f9e8a4a9d4c2ebe9a04b5d2560":"Start accepting donations right away. Donors can support you with all major credit cards and Apple Pay \u2014 with more payment methods coming soon.","94263a893080c76e1e9cecabff0e711c":"Switch to Squarespace Payments","958a9fec513f148078563c23d2728b5a":"Get processing rates as low as {feeRatePlusConstant} with our new plans.","95f17d18f1379fd3d531b91366d13395":"CLOSE","96e8606f09129ebce4c362dc8d1c2f2f":"American Express, Corporate or Business Cards issued by Visa and Mastercard, and International Cards.","96ef5960e5f6a2132b03e698a9ca8605":"Postal Code","9735e8ab52b5a7468ed8bb70f26a94bc":"Action needed to accept new payments","98c11856ce7bc6b317a0cda793b0b1d9":"REQUEST APPEAL","9a1ed910b8bda218aa4854dff6191505":"Dispute lost","9a373356c6540a748e8dd2a730d90eba":"Are you sure you want to restart?","9a698f60005a4e2291b5f1a6fe10a88b":"Account ownership required","9b84850249fbd5077d9ae22338e2fc19":"All new payments will move directly to your upcoming payouts after processing. Funds that are currently on hold will release into future payouts on their scheduled release date.","9bd97d09c94fb951240c8a09faccf7b1":"Finish setting up Squarespace Payments by connecting your {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING}. Your first payout will be sent 15-19 days after you connect your account.","9c0679e8ecb3797ff07f00512800210a":"We encountered an error while processing your information. Please try submitting it again.","9ccd44b9f87715b30ffd4c90bed25cb0":"Learn more about fees","9cddf8e627eb91d3b9f4429b0801ddab":"Submit your information by {actionRequiredByDate} to keep your account active.","9d0da3290262d12a0d741b1c83b4e6c4":"Thanks for verifying your account information. Your payouts are enabled and will be sent to your bank account ending in {last4Formatted}.","9d4059c02b501e4469dc0223a133f82d":"Squarespace Payments account suspended","9de8dcdb519624662d7c26f4a5907c44":"Customers can check out from your store. {actionButton}","9f4aeb6a8dbba4a517f981c53719c3dd":"We're verifying your {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} with a deposit","9f5ca8116f7bc619ecb3f00982e52581":"As low as {rate} for credit cards on {selectPlansLink}","9f6d3fef950cd6e1cb46e750c3b81108":"CANCEL VERIFICATION",a0644dd51fc045e888ad9d2c40d700ca:"Payments will continue to process through Stripe until you provide this information.",a16d9b02b53c75a3738d90eadb9a2ccb:"Bank account successfully connected",a276b707ef84a79edda4db99544dbe0f:"Open dispute",a28619aa0ddd5bf08c359b64ec8c9eca:"Have questions?",a345bc75c1486ab9482b6e2e817b44ec:"Competitive credit card rates starting at {rate} {viewDetailsLink}",a3c63a5cc3ee1cae97b753e7e13ebb39:"Contact Support",a41abbd8eb2b0deae34517f805b381c4:"Successfully cancelled bank verification",a526b940fb4555b4fedd131dde978448:"Verify Identity",a545f947e93d447a8c7414e4ace18c8b:"Offer expires {promoExpiry}",a5b68fe291c70229e77e8967757bcd74:"Currency conversion",a649d2f0fe74d01e019aa7d3d2afb843:"PROCESSING RATES STARTING AT",a69e10a38489880dfdec705395e8fcf0:"CONNECT {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING}",a6b3b9f1db62093c318170283dc7ea78:"Bank account couldn\u2019t be updated",a705c60caab035295757f0108a653fba:"ACH payments will now process at {rate} per transaction. ",a70da118393ed17b188f7595f031d433:"GET STARTED",a756896a01b7509c7983fb2ffd52f49e:"RESTART SETUP",a88f4264c06454f1d042aa4ee054488b:"Use the account owner\u2019s information to complete Squarespace Payments setup. You\u2019ll be able to transfer management access after you create the account.",a8a4802e9d73499ed2a8c15f2cec9074:'This will make Squarespace Payments your primary payment processor, and your Stripe account will be <strong style="font-weight: bold;">detached</strong>. This means:',a92a8cea63972720df502652c1bafb05:"Your payouts are paused",a96cf9a22a06aad914ffab8279cfb877:"You won\u2019t be able to accept payments or receive payouts through Squarespace Payments.",aa1ea2492bb35877e0c4d77cd3663f94:"Domestic personal cards issued by Visa, Mastercard, and other major providers.",aa494bfc7d84b86d28b77947296606a7:"A portion of your available balance has been moved to reserves for a fixed period of time, to help cover refunds, chargebacks and other losses. Your reserves will automatically be added to future payouts if no refunds or chargebacks occur by the expiration date.",ab3706bf5be3b642d1f9427dcaedd6d9:"You don't have any payouts",abfde25d7d990c1ae49fd0d83fa5bf02:"UPDATE INFORMATION",ac364958704a923b35be335442cae145:"Refund failed",ac5fb41bd3d3d749fb0c93eb4a082e63:"Squarespace Payments Processing Rates",ade7630f6995d2aa6f99e89cba2fb4d4:"Discounted card rates as low as {feeRatePlusConstant} on {selectPlansButton}.",ae0e5cbc696a7b857491edee32e9b1e8:"Something went wrong with your bank account connection. To resume payouts, reconnect your bank account to Squarespace Payments.",ae25a76035e07c611c50e4087c73e374:"Your subscription plan only supports Squarespace Payments for businesses operating in {country}. {paymentProcessorsLink}",ae64b52f89e7649085a0efffa6661f6a:"The bank account you connected is a savings account. You'll need to connect a {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} to Squarespace Payments to receive payouts.",aec38e4690b10cdb0e794d7cd5c57c97:"CONTACT SUPPORT",afc4a2f33a9aa3ad8d750f2734950628:"Your customers' payment information will be transferred to your Squarespace Payments account in 3-10 days",b0ca1a9f710a4ef841c0733ae478a779:"{actionButton} to enable payments.",b11b0cb4153cc019a649824dc0b24107:"Switch to Squarespace Payments and get {cardRate} on all CC/DB transactions. Expires {expiry}.",b11b58389bc2a987d720d39251e32eab:"The {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} you connected could not be verified. Try again with an account in good standing and registered to {legalBusinessName}.",b16e500362932b4c6730ea962bd6b92c:"Payouts automatically sent to your bank",b1e7867d45550b691be3c1b3520225fa:"CLOSE",b2c1027da98c6339c9353ccb1dd1fecd:"Plaid will create a biometric scan using a live photo and photo ID that you submit. View the {kbGuideTitleLink} for more information.",b2e868e04dd731818bf2169daddd7b7d:"Payments manager permissions required",b2f0ba9b7703571eac25ff8bbcaf7bf1:"Your customer information and past orders will still be accessible on Squarespace",b3a4880500f89dfc42435575ed95d1b2:"Update payments access in the future",b4ce8c15a88315bd2c310187296bd6a5:"{actionButton} to resume payouts.",b6c466e13acc856ae827cd59224877aa:"CLOSE",b79837058c25f3ec268ec0f475ad9553:"Bank Account Holder",b7c93a82bef19a845cee492e0b464046:"GO BACK",b7feebb83a25f42bedf8c53d0a77d2c9:"on select plans",b806422e5fbfb6fab46b58ed3707d7a4:"By selecting \u201CVerify Identity\u201D, you consent to your identity being verified by Plaid using biometric data in accordance with the {privacyPolicyLink}.\xA0Please reach out to {idvVerificationEmailLink} for an alternative, manual verification.",b8d4eb48995c4c1ee96fac199a2a3d13:"Your {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} is being verified. {actionButton}",b8dba32218c6aebdb2e8bf9b48badc17:"Afterpay",b9a9632354f24b62ee378c8960a12653:"We'll send you an email when your account is activated.",bb3017432fb6f5020786c4437a786fbe:"You can view your financing history and previous payments processed with Stripe on stripe.com.",bb5fc16fdeee1b0efeb41e770ae6a311:"SEE DETAILS",bb8e4f883433f7cc8315a28f3cac2b5b:"Your bank account could not be verified",bbb8fbe78937544ca26b3ef7cf6e79b7:"We'll use this information to verify your identity and keep your account safe.",bbebdd37f2307d5d7a608341c27a1a4c:"Error: Unable to cancel bank verification",bc4980bc6c42fe451b82627ab4b6820c:"Close",bc8d9e8732747c5f425ea310e043fd07:"Bank Account Debit Authorisation",bcae5d9a3b3722747f2f25b7c7eedac4:"Something went wrong",bce4208fa9c2155c0969eca278fae9f8:"Thank you for updating your connected account. We will attempt to debit your account again to resolve your negative balance so that payouts can resume and refunds can be processed.\xA0\xA0",bd9b8a55247982d090946bad905c2cd3:"We were unable to resolve your negative balance by debiting your connected bank account",bda8ad9f532ccb7b911b40bfa571cae1:"Continue setup",bf0a79dd7b941a3b7afa2338a1583768:"Make sure all personal information in your Squarespace Payments account is up-to-date for accurate tax filing and future verification requests.",bfd0d11b421778da5476282b60d153aa:"Empower your customers to pay how they want with all major credit cards and popular payment methods",c18c489e22a12af0f6b25fbd347aa25c:"Credit and debit card processing rate: {feeRatePlusConstant}",c1b97164c41e77bc1888598756d3a26f:"UPLOAD STATEMENT",c2faedf6968e64023a1a0bf0083b8c94:"Your selling history will be preserved",c3ef2a3206e49e48044a6581c3eb5f01:"Domestic cards",c4696b37b38a07c43772a55cec608ed8:"Unable to verify business information",c4e0e9eaded0ea69d5f8372d019d2a7b:"Start accepting invoice payments right away. Clients can pay with all major credit cards, Klarna, Apple Pay, and Clearpay \u2014 with more methods coming soon.",c4f4a5a0263b88183df7948a8d0acc7b:"Bank or Building Society",c57d90baa6d1e5bd792474d9741ae0a7:"Authorise Bank Debits",c69f29812f34eec1aec8414dff41cf1b:"Squarespace Payments Terms",c9eaf5328b791eca1c0018720d7c57b2:"Accept ACH bank payments for a low 1% fee, as well as all major credit cards, Klarna, Apple Pay, and Afterpay",ca688b56332d9cc04bbc401dcd99b187:"By clicking \u201CAgree\u201D, I authorize Squarespace Ireland Limited to debit my bank account through the Single Euro Payments Area (SEPA) if my (or my organization's) account goes negative or for any other reason required pursuant to the {termsLink}. I confirm that I am the only person required to authorize debits from this bank account, and that I have read and agreed to the {authorizationLink}, including the SEPA Direct Debit Mandate.",cae7a992ba5a66e77ae07e3e8bb04dc9:"Your account has been debited and your negative balance has been resolved. Your payout and refund capability has been restored, and no further action is required.",cc50e5a9a2dd19c03d17810db2990369:"switch to squarespace payments",ccdd74c5117d7d5558190b3b9a68a843:"AGREE",cd07a5e58747cb11dec62d1d0b0ad756:"Finish setting up Squarespace Payments by connecting your {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING}.",cdf2ae3aea5b19624cf8c9282f7fd402:"{rate} for credit cards until {expiry}",ce1a1bc59a3b083eb7a9ac5fece91cb9:"Credit card rates",ce416a1b0bf1693b7cd3dc8243de9cef:"Payments and payouts have been paused until your information is verified. This may take a few days.",ceff4980b1671972cd32b8a1ad1bc6e3:"select plans",cf3ac96f768c14fce0cfeb85855f3981:"By clicking \u201CAgree\u201D, I authorise Squarespace Ireland Limited to electronically debit my bank account if my (or my organisation's) account goes negative or for any other reason required pursuant to the {termsLink}, subject to the safeguards assured by the Bankers' Automated Clearing Services (Bacs) Direct Debit Guarantee. I confirm that I am the only person required to authorise debits from this bank account, and that I have read and agree to the {authorizationLink}, including the Bacs Direct Debit Instructions.",cf412155cee2a1a094388d04bc4a142b:"Squarespace Payments - Appeal Request",d04f242ebe013f9e63801b150f7ef31f:"Thanks for verifying your account information. Your payouts are enabled and will be sent to your bank account.",d16bb25e218ed2fcaca036a2d456de7a:"Unable to send payouts",d1d5c40f639b18c788094f6dc247633a:"KB Guide title",d2601e9521d5f2add23e011a2adefdf2:"ACH Direct Debit",d3427ed9136171ec9f995ab164bc5b70:"select plans",d3525c381217699c675db4e437a7e52c:"select plans",d38d06ea87672288d739307b7b672e73:"View all payment processors",d3bc57be4dfec2e69fd3e8f18c9501c6:"IBAN",d3f0e9191a2ea9a86b5b3ea8f5219525:"CLOSE",d5e6b5a0481636038203513d35f36e1d:"A cardholder disputed a payment made in your store.",d619f85610fdcd11bff550fd676e098b:"Your Bank Information",d66e9e5795a9e37f1da96c8bcd410461:"RECONNECT BANK",d6821007e2b2b06acf97fad8160ef529:"contact support",d7757cf4b86dce2439951f1dd192e5b5:"Accept all major credit cards, Klarna, Apple Pay, and Clearpay \u2014 with even more payment methods coming soon",d86a01e356f11091d168f7e9f409be63:"Your account has been successfully imported, but there are a few details we're still missing.",d91b28055fe04aab7f827fb8baa8f32c:"Verify your ownership of your bank account {last4Formatted} by uploading a bank statement from that account. Verification usually takes 1-2 business days. Payouts will be enabled after your information is verified.",d946527779151303a448721b7cc2ee35:"Connect a new bank account to unlock payouts",da3b8edc5a37c689647de54637df7a82:"VIEW ALL PAYMENT OPTIONS",db0700ae8ffbc46ba7699de09de32e21:"Plaid will create a biometric scan using a live photo and photo ID that you submit. If you don't want to use Plaid for verification, you can {manualIdentityVerificationLink}.",db8537352cea09b46c1f4a925037812d:"CONTINUE",dc4ed776896a5e075a22b060b627c271:"Information imported!",dcd8f60da523b76ae35f365983ec8738:"Bank Account Number",dd319ab3e76c04d56648f00875ddf2aa:"Discounted ACH processing rate of {achRate} per transaction.",dd32881298b2b110c46ebcbe8124d077:"Until this problem is resolved, you will not be able to receive payouts or process refunds. To fix this, update your bank account details.\xA0",dd4e2dba514f0be4b9c3413033d46fc4:"Enter deposit verification code",de346e013915a7e170c69b552295e48d:"{rate} per transaction",deb35e0eaf859ea6eca7b5baa73e5691:"Klarna",df811221fdda12d77c8478b5a3444789:"Enter your deposit verification code",dffe06b153cd9c1285dc0c98095f01ab:"Qualify for new financing offers through Squarespace Capital",e14df74cbc0d2afad7108f765aa71539:"Something went wrong",e15a3fe97f0c5d416a83f84a2db87ab2:"Are you setting this up for someone else?",e1d8cd377534cca7e6faf274e2d703e6:"The {CHECKING_ACCOUNT_STRING} you connect must be registered to {legalBusinessName}. Your first payout will be sent 15-19 days after you connect your account.",e2a12d73b3f99aad3a117c921cbd33e3:"Payments from your customers will now come through Squarespace Payments.